{"title":"Nature Is Healing","link":"https://mastodon.social/@BasicAppleGuy/117073366339407186","date":1786545791000,"content":"\n<p>Basic Apple Guy:</p>\n\n<blockquote>\n  <p>Apple just dropped the hardest icon glow-up for the new Chess icon\nin macOS 27 Beta 5.</p>\n</blockquote>\n\n<p><a href=\"/media/45386eefd41f3f5eb7d99ceea512eae05bd0bd9a46d30c2d61f7fa6256e82070.png\">\n<img src=\"/media/45386eefd41f3f5eb7d99ceea512eae05bd0bd9a46d30c2d61f7fa6256e82070.png\" alt=\"Comparison of the Chess app icons in MacOS 27 Golden Gate: betas 1/2, betas 3/4, and an all new-icon for beta 5. The earlier ones show a flat brown knight. The new one in beta 5 shows a fully-articulated 3D silvery knight. The new one looks great. The previous ones look like shit.\" width=\"500\" /></a></p>\n\n<p>This is not just a tweak or small improvement. This is the difference between total shit and a really nice icon.</p>\n\n<div>\n<a href=\"https://daringfireball.net/linked/2026/08/12/nature-is-healing\"> ★ </a>\n</div>\n\n\t","author":"John Gruber","siteTitle":"Daring Fireball","siteHash":"fc569638025dadf22a867470f8215f38855cf50e975782a6c989909474292a36","entryHash":"73ae385dca366d4b31f34340bce8247360bb0cb25daaa02bcf21bf711f18d31e","category":"Tech"}